# One JSON array of { name, url } — the array order maps to the gray
# left-border shades (first calendar = darkest).
# Get each URL from Google Calendar: calendar settings -> "Secret address in
# iCal format".
CALENDARS='[{"name":"Work","url":"https://calendar.google.com/calendar/ical/your-work%40gmail.com/private-YOURID/basic.ics"},{"name":"Personal","url":"https://calendar.google.com/calendar/ical/your-personal%40gmail.com/private-YOURID/basic.ics"}]'
